WEBVTT

00:08.390 --> 00:10.550
AozoraSubs and TMUsubs  present

00:11.000 --> 00:15.390
Daa! Daa! Daa!

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
Mukai awase ni suwatta shunkan ni

00:11.310 --> 00:15.180
The moment we sat facing each other

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
otona no yokogao ni DOKI DOKI shiteru no

00:15.650 --> 00:19.970
my heart was thumping at the sideways view of your adult-like face

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Itsudemo soba ni iru hazu demo

00:20.320 --> 00:24.060
Although you're always beside me

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
hontou wa KIMI no koto yoku shiranai yo ne

00:24.360 --> 00:28.730
the truth is I don't really know much about you

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
Itsumo nakamatachi to asonderu kedo

00:28.910 --> 00:37.450
We're always playing with our friends

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
futarikiri ni naru to doko ka chigau yo

00:37.630 --> 00:43.290
but when we're alone, something's different

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Nanika hanashi kakete

00:43.880 --> 00:46.830
Talk to me about something

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
Zutto dare yori mo daisuki da yo

00:47.550 --> 00:51.960
I've always loved you more than anyone else

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
dakedo ienai yo chikasugiru yo

00:52.020 --> 00:56.300
but I can't say it, you're too close

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Itsuka kizuite yo mitsumeteru yo

00:56.440 --> 01:00.430
Someday, notice I'm gazing at you

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
Koi no TANE wo maitara

01:00.440 --> 01:04.890
When we plant the seeds of love

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
hora sakasou yo ippai

01:05.030 --> 01:09.150
see, they will all bloom fully

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
Mou kamisama ni onegai

01:09.530 --> 01:14.950
That's my wish to God

01:41.420 --> 01:44.030
It looks like a transmission signal from somewhere…

01:46.690 --> 01:48.470
Oh! This is-

01:49.490 --> 01:51.040
Ah! The signal-!

01:56.220 --> 02:01.180
Cultural Festival with Ruu-kun in Lead Role

02:05.140 --> 02:07.840
The Wonderful Dream of Man (and Monkey)

02:07.690 --> 02:11.860
Sorry to keep you waiting. The theme for this year's cultural festival hand-made

02:11.860 --> 02:14.730
paper mache parade is “Mankind and Monkey's Wonderful Dream”.

02:15.680 --> 02:18.770
Just what do you mean by that paper-mache parade?

02:18.770 --> 02:21.370
Just what do you mean by "Man and Monkey"?

02:21.370 --> 02:24.910
In other words, the hand-made paper mache objects

02:24.910 --> 02:27.750
are the special attraction of the event.

02:27.750 --> 02:31.380
As far as I know, the themes in the past had been

02:31.380 --> 02:33.000
"The wonderful nature of mankind and monkey",

02:33.000 --> 02:35.710
"The wonderful festival of mankind and monkey",

02:35.710 --> 02:40.460
"The wonderful  world tour of mankind and monkey".

02:40.460 --> 02:44.470
Well, monkey is always the principal's pet motif,

02:44.470 --> 02:47.600
so I guess this year's theme is "Dream"

02:47.600 --> 02:48.510
Dream?

02:48.510 --> 02:49.740
Space…..

02:50.940 --> 02:52.220
Space?

02:52.220 --> 02:59.830
The word "dream" reminded me a bit of my mom…
mom's someone who believed in her dreams

02:59.830 --> 03:04.870
That's right. Your mother's the one who made her dream of traveling in space a reality, right?

03:04.870 --> 03:07.020
It's not reality as yet.

03:07.020 --> 03:08.460
That's it!

03:09.070 --> 03:15.380
How about making "Space" our class theme? We can make a huge space shuttle…

03:15.660 --> 03:16.840
Kanata…

03:17.140 --> 03:19.660
That's nice – Dream of Space

03:19.660 --> 03:26.510
"Space"…when you hear that word, it invokes such lovely images.

03:26.510 --> 03:29.430
That's right! How about a musical?

03:29.430 --> 03:33.900
Musical…means singing and dancing with Kanata-kun!

03:33.900 --> 03:41.610
Even if we're just sitting there, there will be some heart-stopping moments…

03:41.610 --> 03:46.490
just the idea of Kanata-kun singing and dancing…

03:46.490 --> 03:52.660
Singing and dancing….how wonderful! Truly a perfect plan for me!

03:53.000 --> 03:56.630
Er…so, the theme for this class is "Dream of Space"

03:56.630 --> 03:58.390
A Musical!

03:58.390 --> 03:59.550
So, are we all fine with that?

03:59.550 --> 04:01.500
Yes---

04:08.010 --> 04:09.530
Ta-da!

04:09.930 --> 04:10.780
Eh?

04:10.780 --> 04:12.430
What are you guys doing here?

04:12.430 --> 04:16.190
We're here to prepare for the school festival.

04:16.190 --> 04:18.490
Or should we say, we're all free now.

04:18.490 --> 04:23.720
Well, anyway, let's get as much as possible done.
Let's go this-a-way!

04:23.720 --> 04:25.950
Oh no! Aya-chan's on a roll!

04:26.220 --> 04:27.660
Excuse us!

04:28.540 --> 04:30.990
Shoot! I guess we have to spend time with them now.

04:30.990 --> 04:31.370
Yeah

04:46.220 --> 04:48.250
What are you making, Miyu?

04:48.250 --> 04:50.430
What am I making? Can't you see?

04:50.430 --> 04:52.450
Ah…space jellyfish?

04:52.450 --> 04:53.410
It's a space suit!

04:53.410 --> 05:00.530
Ooh! That's just the way a girl talks with the boy she likes!

05:00.530 --> 05:05.140
"Oh Kanata-kun, you bully! I hate you!" she'll say

05:05.140 --> 05:09.360
but in her heart it's a different story!

05:09.360 --> 05:11.360
That's my…

05:11.360 --> 05:13.630
Chris-chan, don't fool around.

05:13.630 --> 05:14.960
Excuse me

05:17.980 --> 05:19.000
Thanks

05:20.350 --> 05:23.130
Guys, do you want to know what I'm making?

05:23.130 --> 05:25.080
Eh…not really.

05:25.420 --> 05:29.300
Oh, well. I guess it can't be helped. Since you insist, I'll tell you.

05:29.300 --> 05:31.040
My individualistic theme.

05:31.040 --> 05:33.090
I am the Star prince!

05:34.060 --> 05:38.150
Thank you, Okame-chan. Only I can do justice to this outfit, don't you think?

05:38.150 --> 05:39.620
No doubt about that.

05:39.620 --> 05:41.630
Looks that way, doesn't it?

05:41.630 --> 05:44.040
Mine is in the image of a shooting star.

05:44.040 --> 05:44.720
So...

05:44.720 --> 05:47.150
If it's shining, then it could work.

05:47.150 --> 05:52.120
Too small! Too small! Mine is the solar system! Check it out!

05:52.380 --> 05:54.170
It's a good design.

05:54.170 --> 05:55.120
Isn't that good?

05:55.120 --> 05:57.230
It'd be better if it was bigger.

05:57.230 --> 05:58.210
It's great!

05:58.210 --> 05:59.170
How about the color?

05:58.480 --> 05:59.170
Hey!

06:00.740 --> 06:02.130
Bye!

06:02.130 --> 06:05.390
They were really like a hurricane, weren't they?

06:05.840 --> 06:06.910
But…

06:07.690 --> 06:08.470
Huh?

06:08.470 --> 06:10.880
Being with them was…kind of fun

06:12.600 --> 06:17.820
Ah, speaking of which, I wonder what Ruu-kun and Wannya are doing. Have they gone out somewhere?

06:17.820 --> 06:19.770
Come to think of it, I didn't see them anywhere

06:19.770 --> 06:21.230
Er…

06:21.230 --> 06:23.760
Waa! Ruu-kun! Wannya!

06:24.410 --> 06:25.460
Pepo!

06:25.460 --> 06:28.240
Er.. Miyu-san, Kanata-san….

06:29.660 --> 06:30.910
What is it?

06:30.910 --> 06:31.710
Ah…

06:33.400 --> 06:34.410
Something the matter?

06:36.270 --> 06:42.130
Er…um…I was about to go buy stuff for dinner.
What would you like?

06:42.130 --> 06:43.100
Pumpkin.

06:43.100 --> 06:43.840
Not again!

06:43.840 --> 06:45.650
Well then, what do you want?

06:45.650 --> 06:47.460
Fine, fine. Let's have pumpkin

06:47.460 --> 06:49.550
Got it. Pumpkin, right?

06:49.550 --> 06:50.700
Wannya!

07:11.210 --> 07:14.370
Those who can stay after school, please stay here.

07:11.360 --> 07:14.370
Today's plan: Finish work on the space shuttle

07:19.790 --> 07:23.000
By the way, when's your mother taking off for space, Miyu?

07:23.000 --> 07:28.820
Well, from what she told me on phone before, it seems her work at NASA will be over soon.

07:29.560 --> 07:32.590
Finally, we're about to fly off to space! Isn't it great!

07:32.590 --> 07:36.470
So, will your parents return to Japan after that?

07:36.750 --> 07:37.400
Yes

07:37.400 --> 07:41.860
I see. So that means you'll go back to your own house?

07:44.920 --> 07:46.570
What!?

07:46.570 --> 07:50.030
Miyu-chin, that means you're going to transfer to another school then?

07:50.030 --> 07:55.280
Oh my god! No way we are going to be separated so easily!

07:55.280 --> 08:00.000
I mean, we're bound together by the strings of fate!

08:00.000 --> 08:01.460
I said, stop it!

08:03.130 --> 08:06.040
Of course we're bound to each other.

08:06.040 --> 08:08.460
Stop it! Stop it! Stop it!

08:08.460 --> 08:10.190
Hey! Me too!

08:11.390 --> 08:12.540
Oh no!

08:12.540 --> 08:14.340
We can use that step in the musical!

08:14.340 --> 08:17.340
Everybody seems to be getting into it.

08:19.560 --> 08:26.100
That's right. Someday I'm going to have to leave and go home.
I'd forgotten all about it.

08:56.370 --> 08:57.730
Hey, that's the phone…

08:57.730 --> 08:59.530
Isn't Wannya home?

09:01.370 --> 09:02.590
Rock-paper-scissors

09:03.870 --> 09:05.580
Shoot!

09:05.580 --> 09:07.560
Hurry up before it stops ringing.

09:14.380 --> 09:17.060
Saionji residence.

09:17.060 --> 09:18.450
Miyu!

09:18.450 --> 09:19.260
Mama!

09:19.260 --> 09:20.330
Papa's here too!

09:20.330 --> 09:21.600
Hey, give it back!

09:21.600 --> 09:23.170
Just let me-

09:24.600 --> 09:25.910
Are you doing well, Miyu?

09:25.910 --> 09:28.420
Yes. I just got back from school.

09:29.570 --> 09:31.400
I see.

09:31.400 --> 09:33.260
Hey, what' s Miyu saying?

09:33.260 --> 09:34.990
Did you miss me?

09:34.990 --> 09:37.320
Well, just a bit

09:37.320 --> 09:38.840
I knew it!

09:39.970 --> 09:42.430
I'm so happy! You see…

09:44.010 --> 09:44.850
Eh?

09:47.860 --> 09:51.020
The launch date of the space shuttle has finally been decided.

09:51.020 --> 09:55.850
I know you've been feeling lonely, but we're going to return to Japan soon

09:55.850 --> 09:58.330
and then we'll all be together.

10:03.120 --> 10:06.190
Yeah…yeah…okay. Bye.

10:10.790 --> 10:13.320
Miyu, who was it on the phone?

10:16.220 --> 10:17.710
I'll go change.

10:17.710 --> 10:18.380
Okay.

10:27.500 --> 10:31.020
Mama and Papa... are coming back.

11:11.400 --> 11:13.280
Good morning- Oh!

11:13.280 --> 11:15.570
Wow! It's done!!

11:15.840 --> 11:17.450
We did it!

11:17.450 --> 11:18.730
Looks like the real thing!

11:18.730 --> 11:20.910
Have you seen the real thing before?

11:20.910 --> 11:27.290
No, I have been to Florida, but I didn't get to see it. Have You been to Florida?

11:27.290 --> 11:28.860
Get real!

11:28.860 --> 11:31.310
You must have seen the real one before, right, Miyu-chan?

11:31.310 --> 11:34.340
Um…yeah, that's right. This is really good.

11:34.610 --> 11:39.440
Sorry to keep you waiting, guys. You've done a great job.

11:39.440 --> 11:47.700
Here are the scripts for the paper mache parade.

11:47.700 --> 11:53.500
Now let's practice for the musical!

11:53.500 --> 11:57.160
Ah- this lead role- don't tell me….

11:57.160 --> 11:59.150
I have a really bad feeling about this.

11:59.150 --> 12:03.200
It's the story of a small baby on a UFO.

12:03.200 --> 12:10.970
He travels through space and then reaches Earth where he meets a boy and a girl.

12:10.970 --> 12:12.300
What the-?

12:12.300 --> 12:13.370
This is bad

12:13.370 --> 12:16.190
So, I'll leave you to it.

12:19.980 --> 12:21.440
A musical?

12:22.200 --> 12:23.760
Aya-chan was rather persistent…

12:24.040 --> 12:25.820
Please understand, Wannya!

12:29.790 --> 12:30.860
Wannya…

12:30.860 --> 12:34.310
So when is that cultural festival?

12:34.310 --> 12:36.840
One week from now.

12:36.840 --> 12:38.150
I see

12:40.060 --> 12:44.080
That's why from we'd like to take Ruu with us for practice starting tomorrow.

12:44.450 --> 12:53.780
Er…actually, you see…actually….actually….

12:56.890 --> 12:57.580
Actually…?

13:00.550 --> 13:05.300
Um…er….how about pumpkin for dinner tonight as well?

13:05.640 --> 13:08.050
That's fine, but what about the cultural festival?

13:08.360 --> 13:13.700
About that, I get it.
Ruu-sama, you're not allowed to use your powers.

13:14.560 --> 13:18.230
7 days till the cultural festival

13:14.850 --> 13:18.230
Seven days to go till the cultural festival. Let's get going!

13:18.230 --> 13:21.190
Saionji-kun, hold Ruu-kun right there!

13:22.250 --> 13:24.490
Kurosu-kun, you revolve over there!

13:24.490 --> 13:26.450
Okay!

13:28.910 --> 13:31.000
What's this!?

13:31.000 --> 13:32.710
You both are doing great!

13:32.710 --> 13:34.250
Ruu-kun, no!

13:34.250 --> 13:36.210
6 days till the cultural festival

13:36.210 --> 13:39.110
Ooh…look at me….

13:40.670 --> 13:42.130
5 days till the cultural festival

13:46.590 --> 13:48.010
4 days till the cultural festival

13:52.010 --> 13:53.470
3 days till the cultural festival

13:57.440 --> 13:58.900
2 days till the cultural festival

14:00.860 --> 14:02.320
Finally 1 day till the cultural festival

14:33.500 --> 14:34.550
Kanata!

14:34.550 --> 14:37.810
The milk's warm. Want some?

14:39.770 --> 14:40.720
Okay.

14:43.540 --> 14:46.880
I'm feeling a bit nervous about tomorrow.

14:51.100 --> 14:52.980
Something on your mind?

14:59.860 --> 15:02.990
You're welcome to keep your thoughts to yourself.

15:06.430 --> 15:14.250
Me, Ruu, Wannya… we're all here for you. Anytime you want to talk, you're welcome.

15:22.670 --> 15:29.030
Here for me…that's right. Maybe if I ask for his advice, he may come up with something.

15:30.230 --> 15:38.510
Er…listen, Kanata…um…mom's launch date has been fixed.

15:38.510 --> 15:41.960
Once it's over, they said they'll be returning to Japan.

15:50.210 --> 15:53.680
If you can come up with a plan, tell me, Kanata.

15:55.340 --> 15:59.180
Um…here…

16:00.950 --> 16:03.840
Dear Kanata, how are you?

16:03.840 --> 16:08.040
My training will be over soon and I'll be coming back to Japan.

16:08.040 --> 16:11.570
This time when I get back, I won't leave again.

16:11.570 --> 16:15.870
The day to day routine at Saionji Temple is training enough for me.

16:15.870 --> 16:18.770
I'll be in touch. Houshou.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.700
He sent it from Kyoto.

16:21.700 --> 16:28.880
I see. At this rate we'll all be separated…

16:33.970 --> 16:35.140
Er…

16:35.140 --> 16:36.800
Wannya! Ruu-kun!

16:40.120 --> 16:44.140
Er…there's something I have to tell you…

16:44.140 --> 16:48.480
The UFO's satellite received a message.

16:48.480 --> 16:54.050
Otto's rescue squad has sent word that they'll be coming to Earth.

16:54.050 --> 16:58.700
If they hurry, They will be here by the next full moon.

16:58.700 --> 17:05.600
I thought I'd tell you as soon as possible, but I couldn't. I'm sorry.

17:08.090 --> 17:09.240
That's….

17:11.000 --> 17:13.170
Wannya! Wannya!

17:13.170 --> 17:17.310
Ah! That's- that's great news!

17:18.100 --> 17:21.120
That settles everything.

17:21.120 --> 17:28.030
I was worrying myself sick, wondering what to do if we couldn't be together.

17:28.030 --> 17:32.030
I should have talked with you guys sooner!

17:33.080 --> 17:35.110
Mama! Mama!

17:35.110 --> 17:36.300
Ruu-kun…

17:40.830 --> 17:41.760
Mama

17:41.760 --> 17:46.320
Isn't it great, Ruu-kun?
You're going back to Otto, back to your parents.

17:46.320 --> 17:48.360
Papa! Papa!

17:48.360 --> 17:49.250
Miyu…

17:49.250 --> 17:51.710
Well, tomorrow's our big day, so I have to get some sleep now.

17:59.870 --> 18:01.240
Silly Miyu…

18:04.970 --> 18:07.520
No.4 Junior High School, 13th School Festival

18:15.160 --> 18:17.240
Alright everyone! Here we go!

18:17.570 --> 18:19.200
Okay!

18:26.010 --> 18:28.560
Oh no! We forgot all about the monkey!

18:28.560 --> 18:28.790
What!?

18:28.790 --> 18:31.370
Leave the monkey to me!

18:32.100 --> 18:33.710
Principal

18:33.710 --> 18:35.270
Phew! We did it!

18:37.530 --> 18:41.420
For now let's just have fun. That's all.

18:42.030 --> 18:50.330
We're the asteroid clusters, Spinning and spinning. If you don't watch out, it'll be dangerous!

18:50.330 --> 18:54.980
Wait…! What's that kid doing there? Ruu!!

18:57.410 --> 19:03.380
I'm the Star Prince. Welcome to my star.

19:03.380 --> 19:11.580
Oh, is that a UFO? Is it broken? I'll lend it some of my power. Come on, shooting star!

19:09.810 --> 19:10.850
This is fun!

19:11.580 --> 19:15.880
I'm the shooting star. The wishing star.

19:16.830 --> 19:19.790
If you have a wish, I'll make it come true.

19:18.440 --> 19:23.850
I'm having so much fun with them all…I don't want to go anywhere…

19:24.560 --> 19:26.720
Alright, Okame-chan. Rain down the stars.

19:28.940 --> 19:29.680
What's the matter!?

19:31.550 --> 19:32.940
Okame-chan, the stars!

19:33.550 --> 19:37.810
Okame-chan! Okame-chan!

19:45.280 --> 19:46.490
Ruu-kun! No!

19:49.830 --> 19:53.710
If you use your powers, your secret will be exposed.

19:55.840 --> 20:03.960
And then, before you know it, -ah, the light's so dazzling, it's making my eyes water…

20:06.050 --> 20:08.460
But it looks like everything's going to be fine.

20:08.460 --> 20:13.520
Just now…was it my imagination or did he actually fly?

20:14.510 --> 20:16.240
That was close!

20:24.990 --> 20:27.900
You are enjoying yourself, aren't you, Ruu-kun?

20:27.900 --> 20:28.910
Mama!

20:31.370 --> 20:32.670
Miyu-san…

20:33.330 --> 20:36.790
What incredible magic!

20:37.520 --> 20:39.210
Winner Year 2, Class 1

20:37.520 --> 20:39.210
We won!

20:39.210 --> 20:42.820
"You, as a class, have achieved this success"

20:39.220 --> 20:41.360
This is all thanks to Ruu-kun!

20:41.360 --> 20:42.820
Hey everyone, did you hear?

20:42.820 --> 20:44.330
Is that what sensei said?

20:44.330 --> 20:48.350
Miyu-chin's mom is going to board the next space shuttle.

20:49.640 --> 20:53.310
Oh, that means there will be no Miyu-chan or Kanata-kun.

21:06.780 --> 21:07.760
Miyu

21:11.100 --> 21:13.910
Heh heh heh….we won after all.

21:13.910 --> 21:18.920
Miyu-san, please don't hold yourself back.

21:21.880 --> 21:27.190
I was also confused about how I should tell you about my old man's letter,

21:27.190 --> 21:31.440
so I'm not in any position to say this, but no matter what,

21:31.440 --> 21:34.000
this day would have had to come anyway.

21:35.270 --> 21:37.020
I know.

21:37.020 --> 21:42.830
I'll be going back to where I was before I came to Saionji.

21:42.830 --> 21:44.070
So…

21:44.070 --> 21:46.610
So…don't hide it.

21:47.850 --> 21:52.880
Don't carry the burden all by yourself.
Whatever is on your mind, just speak up.

22:20.940 --> 22:24.150
I don't want to be separated…
I don't want to be separated…

22:24.940 --> 22:27.110
from you….

22:27.110 --> 22:28.940
or Wannya…

22:30.790 --> 22:32.120
or Ruu-kun…

22:35.320 --> 22:36.940
I don't want to be separated…

22:43.300 --> 22:45.130
Mama! Papa!

22:49.040 --> 22:50.090
Mama?

22:54.100 --> 22:57.060
So that's the secret of the wonderful magic…

22:57.810 --> 23:01.580
Ruu-kun was actually flying just now…

23:02.170 --> 23:05.420
So that wasn't my imagination….

23:06.360 --> 23:07.490
this is magic…

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
Motto tanoshii koto ga

23:19.950 --> 23:24.770
I felt that everyday

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
afureru mainichi

23:25.410 --> 23:28.400
more fun-filled days

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
matteru kigashita

23:29.200 --> 23:33.530
were waiting ahead

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
datte kimi to mata aeta kara

23:35.380 --> 23:42.880
because I was able to meet you again

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Nee ima wa aserazu

23:42.970 --> 23:48.700
Hey, don't be in rush now

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Yukkuri aruite

23:49.890 --> 23:53.260
Walk slowly

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Takusan waratte

23:53.560 --> 23:57.050
Laugh a lot

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
Soshite nanika wo mitsuketara

23:57.320 --> 24:01.390
And when you find something

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
daiji ni shiyou

24:01.620 --> 24:04.980
let's cherish it

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
mata aeta ne

24:05.450 --> 24:08.650
until we meet again

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Issho ni iyou

24:09.200 --> 24:14.700
Let's stay together

24:23.270 --> 24:29.900
The End

24:29.900 --> 25:00.000
Next episode

24:32.030 --> 24:35.240
I would have liked to say what was on my mind to Kanata.

24:35.240 --> 24:37.200
How about pumpkin for dinner?

24:37.200 --> 24:39.140
Whatever.

24:39.140 --> 24:41.240
The space shuttle has been launched.

24:41.240 --> 24:43.740
The rescue mission from Otto is here on Earth.

24:43.740 --> 24:45.200
Next on Daa!Daa!Daa!

24:45.200 --> 24:49.910
We have to tell Momoka-chan about Ruu-kun!

24:49.910 --> 24:51.960
let's all go to Momoland.

24:54.110 --> 24:56.320
Everyone's gathered here.

24:54.110 --> 25:00.000
Night of the Full Moon
